14.	Change into the project directory.
15.	Activate the Python virtual environment if used.
16.	Review vars.yml, especially names, IP addresses, network, template, datastore and resource sizing.
17.	Confirm secrets.yml is encrypted and available.
18.	Run the syntax check.
19.	Run the playbook and enter the Vault password when prompted.
